# The builds write LF: keep every text file LF on every OS (a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise
# check out CRLF, and a byte comparison of a fresh build with docs/ would show every generated file as different)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
